      "message": "powre_handle_state calls common_intel_x86_power_handle_state (line 346), which does the same (call intel_x86_wait_power_up_ok).\n\nHave you taken a look at CONFIG_CHARGER_MIN_POWER_MW_FOR_POWER_ON? If it\u0027s properly set, this change shouldn\u0027t be needed.\n\nCan you please clarify if I\u0027m missing something?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 261,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 265,
        "endChar": 3
      },
      "revId": "7a7e1ba92359624a57442442081b7a67769b198b",
